"陈兰梅成反时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o024b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o024b-q","source_order":[17,77,"O024b"],"order":3532}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0005","name":"陈兰","evidence":["zhangle-q-o007","dongyuan-q-o077","liusima-q-a8d527114c9f45a1f1dc","lizang-q-bdd70f228a9ccac98fc5","lizang-q-4074cb161bcadbb85cb1"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o007-zhangle-p0005","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o007"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o024-zhangle-p0005","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o024"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o030-zhangle-p0005","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o030"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o077-zhangle-p0005","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o077"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o077a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-cbd1ef8c65c37da4f10d","layer":"original","quote":"术前为吕布所破，后为太祖所败。奔其部曲雷薄、陈兰于灊山〖12〗；复为所拒。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":426,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o077","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-cbd1ef8c65c37da4f10d","layer":"original","quote":"术前为吕布所破，后为太祖所败。奔其部曲雷薄、陈兰于灊山〖12〗；复为所拒。忧惧不知所出，将归帝号于绍〖13〗。欲至青州从袁谭，发病，道死〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":426,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":76},{"id":"liusima-q-a8d527114c9f45a1f1dc","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-e03e118fcee75a0aa821","layer":"original","quote":"庐江梅乾、雷绪、陈兰等，聚众数万在江、淮间，郡县残破","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":55},{"id":"lizang-q-0969af22177c0d34bef3","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"权遣数万人乘船屯舒口〖21〗，分兵救兰；闻霸军在舒，遁还","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":91,"end":119},{"id":"lizang-q-4074cb161bcadbb85cb1","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"由是贼不得救兰，辽遂破之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":156,"end":168},{"id":"lizang-q-65609a4314c327416cc6","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"当复遣兵邀霸于夹石，与战，破之，还屯舒","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":67,"end":86},{"id":"lizang-q-9f0ea2d46605029e516e","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"当遣兵逆霸，霸与战于逢龙","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":50,"end":62},{"id":"lizang-q-bdd70f228a9ccac98fc5","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"霸别遣至皖，讨吴将韩当〖18〗，使权不得救兰","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":49},{"id":"lizang-q-e5e222d5085d2aebbcde","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-a2faefedd285c615946b","layer":"original","quote":"霸夜追之，比明，行百余里，邀贼，前后击之；贼窘急，不得上船，赴水者甚众","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":120,"end":155},{"id":"zhangle-e-o007a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-540c45abdbf8dfcd0bc0","layer":"original","quote":"陈兰、梅成以（氐）〔灊〕、六县叛〖2〗。太祖遣于禁、臧霸等讨成，辽督张郃、牛盖等讨兰。成伪降禁，禁还；成遂将其众就兰，转入灊山〖3〗。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":18,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"zhangle-e-o007b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-540c45abdbf8dfcd0bc0","layer":"original","quote":"灊中有天柱山〖4〗，高峻二十余里；道险狭，步径才通〖5〗。兰等壁其上，辽欲进，诸将曰：“兵少道险，难用深入。”辽曰：“此所谓一与一〖6〗，勇者得前耳。”遂进到山下安营，攻之。斩兰、成首，尽虏其众。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":18,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":67,"end":165},{"id":"zhangle-e-o024b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-2054209ec53879913efe","layer":"original","quote":"辽等与兰相持，军食少；禁运粮前后相属，辽遂斩兰、成。增邑二百户，并前千二百户。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":41,"end":80},{"id":"zhangle-q-o007","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-540c45abdbf8dfcd0bc0","layer":"original","quote":"陈兰、梅成以（氐）〔灊〕、六县叛〖2〗。太祖遣于禁、臧霸等讨成，辽督张郃、牛盖等讨兰。成伪降禁，禁还；成遂将其众就兰，转入灊山〖3〗。灊中有天柱山〖4〗，高峻二十余里；道险狭，步径才通〖5〗。兰等壁其上，辽欲进，诸将曰：“兵少道险，难用深入。”辽曰：“此所谓一与一〖6〗，勇者得前耳。”遂进到山下安营，攻之。斩兰、成首，尽虏其众。太祖论诸将功，曰：“登天山，履峻险，以取兰、成：荡寇功也。”增邑，假节。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":18,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":201},{"id":"zhangle-q-o024","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-2054209ec53879913efe","layer":"original","quote":"后与臧霸等攻梅成，张辽、张郃等讨陈兰。禁到，成举众三千余人降；既降复叛，其众奔兰。辽等与兰相持，军食少；禁运粮前后相属，辽遂斩兰、成。增邑二百户，并前千二百户。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80},{"id":"zhangle-q-o030","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-3855d855bdd81918b067","layer":"original","quote":"拜郃偏将军，封都亭侯，授以众。从攻邺，拔之。又从击袁谭于勃海，别将军围雍奴，大破之。从讨柳城，与张辽俱为军锋，以功迁平狄将军〖4〗。别征东莱，讨管承；又与张辽讨陈兰、梅成等，破之。从破马超、韩遂于渭南。围安定，降杨秋。与夏侯渊讨鄜贼梁兴及武都氐。又破马超，平宋建。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":132}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
